================================================================================
VERDICT — Envelope Penetration Ratio P(t)
================================================================================
LEAKAGE CONTROL: P built ONLY from the 60 S5 bars composing M5 bar k; forward
target measured from close of bar k onward (no shared bars). Full-60-S5 M5 bars
only. Real per-bar spread (ask_c-bid_c). Pooled n~271K, 12 pairs.

1. DIRECTION (Psigned): CONTRARIAN, robust, but UN-tradeable net spread.
   Pooled IC: h1 -0.018(t-7.1) h2 -0.021(t-8.9) h3 -0.020(t-8.9)
              h6 -0.022(t-11.3) h12 -0.027(t-15.0). WF all-negative every horizon.
   Per-pair h6: 11/12 negative (AUD_USD n=7407 noisy +). MC p<0.05 (huge n).
   Signed breach => price FADES it (upward breach -> down next, vice versa).
   ECONOMICS: best fade bucket (bottom Psig decile, h12) raw +1.33p -> NET -1.15p
   after ~2.48p spread. fade_net AND follow_net negative in EVERY decile, EVERY h.
   => REAL contrarian direction signal, magnitude ~0.02 IC, spread-blocked. Not tradeable.

2. MAGNITUDE / VOL: prior ("breach intensity -> future vol") FAILS.
   ic_mag NEGATIVE (h6 -0.0089 t-3.6), ic_vol NEGATIVE & weak (h6 -0.0044 t-1.5).
   Decile fwd_abs flat 14.2->13.8, fwd_vol flat ~6.2-6.4. High P -> if anything
   slightly QUIETER ahead (spent move), NOT more vol. P is NOT a magnitude/vol gate.

3. PERSISTENCE: autocorr(P) decays 0.150->0.130->0.123->0.110->0.096 (lag 1,3,6,12,24).
   Mild persistence; NOT a strong trending-vs-ranging regime classifier.
   Decile fwd_dir/abs/vol show no clean regime separation.

4. CONDITIONAL: no P or Psigned bucket has a tradeable directional tilt net spread.

BOTTOM LINE: P is a WEAK CONTRARIAN DIRECTION measure (real, multi-pair, WF-stable,
but ~0.02 IC, fully spread-blocked) and is NOT the magnitude/vol-regime gate the prior
predicted (that sign is reversed/insignificant). Same wall as spread_sigma /
overextension_conditional / trend_vs_contrarian. Only conceivable use: a faint
contrarian tilt input to a multi-feature net on a pair with an independent edge --
not a standalone signal, not even a clean vol gate. CLOSED-NEGATIVE for deployment.
